{
  "book": "2nephi",
  "bookName": "2 Nephi",
  "chapter": 6,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 329.125,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The words of Jacob, the brother of Nephi,",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 2.874,
      "end": 5.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake unto the people of Nephi:",
      "verse": "6:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.969,
      "end": 7.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.099,
      "end": 10.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Jacob, having been called of God,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.88,
      "end": 14.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ordained after the manner of his holy order,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 14.404,
      "end": 21.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having been consecrated by my brother Nephi, unto whom ye look as a king or a protector,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.457,
      "end": 23.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on whom ye depend for safety,",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.913,
      "end": 28.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold ye know that I have spoken unto you exceedingly many things.",
      "verse": "6:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.376,
      "end": 31.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, I speak unto you again;",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 31.832,
      "end": 34.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I am desirous for the welfare of your souls.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 34.984,
      "end": 36.981,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, mine anxiety is great for you;",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 37.161,
      "end": 40.133,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye yourselves know that it ever has been.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 40.313,
      "end": 43.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I have exhorted you with all diligence;",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 43.187,
      "end": 46.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have taught you the words of my father;",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 46.618,
      "end": 52.841,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have spoken unto you concerning all things which are written, from the creation of the world.",
      "verse": "6:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.521,
      "end": 57.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, behold, I would speak unto you concerning things which are,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 57.741,
      "end": 59.181,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and which are to come;",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 59.361,
      "end": 62.426,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, I will read you the words of Isaiah.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 62.606,
      "end": 67.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they are the words which my brother has desired that I should speak unto you.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 67.987,
      "end": 70.17,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I speak unto you for your sakes,",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 70.35,
      "end": 73.833,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may learn and glorify the name of your God.",
      "verse": "6:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 74.513,
      "end": 81.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, the words which I shall read are they which Isaiah spake concerning all the house of Israel;",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.473,
      "end": 84.027,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, they may be likened unto you,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 84.207,
      "end": 86.715,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for ye are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 86.895,
      "end": 90.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there are many things which have been spoken by Isaiah",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 90.279,
      "end": 92.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which may be likened unto you,",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 92.409,
      "end": 95.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "because ye are of the house of Israel.",
      "verse": "6:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 95.875,
      "end": 98.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, these are the words:",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 98.238,
      "end": 100.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus saith the Lord God:",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 100.322,
      "end": 103.201,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I will lift up mine hand to the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 103.381,
      "end": 105.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and set up my standard to the people;",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 106.069,
      "end": 108.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall bring thy sons in their arms,",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 109.128,
      "end": 112.89,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy daughters shall be carried upon their shoulders.",
      "verse": "6:6",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 113.57,
      "end": 116.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And kings shall be thy nursing fathers,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 116.397,
      "end": 119.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their queens thy nursing mothers;",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 119.271,
      "end": 123.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall bow down to thee with their faces towards the earth,",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 123.584,
      "end": 126.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and lick up the dust of thy feet;",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 126.318,
      "end": 128.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thou shalt know that I am the Lord;",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 128.774,
      "end": 131.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they shall not be ashamed that wait for me.",
      "verse": "6:7",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 132.055,
      "end": 135.631,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Jacob, would speak somewhat concerning these words.",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 135.811,
      "end": 138.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the Lord has shown me",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 138.267,
      "end": 140.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that those who were at Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 140.862,
      "end": 142.395,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from whence we came,",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 142.575,
      "end": 145.036,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "have been slain and carried away captive.",
      "verse": "6:8",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 145.716,
      "end": 148.27,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, the Lord has shown unto me",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 148.45,
      "end": 150.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should return again.",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 150.441,
      "end": 152.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also has shown unto me",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 152.664,
      "end": 155.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Lord God, the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 155.863,
      "end": 159.114,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should manifest himself unto them in the flesh;",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 159.294,
      "end": 161.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and after he should manifest himself",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 161.796,
      "end": 166.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should scourge him and crucify him, according to the words of the angel who spake it unto me.",
      "verse": "6:9",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 167.584,
      "end": 170.185,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after they have hardened their hearts",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 170.365,
      "end": 173.569,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stiffened their necks against the Holy One of Israel,",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 173.749,
      "end": 177.882,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, the judgments of the Holy One of Israel shall come upon them.",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 178.062,
      "end": 181.452,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the day cometh that they shall be smitten and afflicted.",
      "verse": "6:10",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 182.132,
      "end": 184.779,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, after they are driven to and fro,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 184.959,
      "end": 186.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for thus saith the angel,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 186.95,
      "end": 189.318,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many shall be afflicted in the flesh,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 189.498,
      "end": 193.724,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and shall not be suffered to perish, because of the prayers of the faithful;",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 193.904,
      "end": 197.108,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be scattered, and smitten, and hated;",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 197.288,
      "end": 200.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, the Lord will be merciful unto them,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 200.487,
      "end": 204.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that when they shall come to the knowledge of their Redeemer,",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 204.196,
      "end": 208.747,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be gathered together again to the lands of their inheritance.",
      "verse": "6:11",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 209.427,
      "end": 211.238,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And blessed are the Gentiles,",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 211.418,
      "end": 213.647,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they of whom the prophet has written;",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 213.827,
      "end": 216.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, if it so be that they shall repent",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 217.165,
      "end": 219.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fight not against Zion,",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 219.481,
      "end": 223.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do not unite themselves to that great and abominable church,",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 223.608,
      "end": 225.233,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be saved;",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 225.413,
      "end": 228.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Lord God will fulfil his covenants",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 228.472,
      "end": 230.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he has made unto his children;",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 230.51,
      "end": 233.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and for this cause the prophet has written these things.",
      "verse": "6:12",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 234.627,
      "end": 237.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore, they that fight against Zion",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 237.501,
      "end": 240.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the covenant people of the Lord",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 240.235,
      "end": 242.65,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall lick up the dust of their feet;",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 242.83,
      "end": 245.524,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the people of the Lord shall not be ashamed.",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 245.704,
      "end": 248.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For the people of the Lord are they who wait for him;",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 248.67,
      "end": 251.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they still wait for the coming of the Messiah.",
      "verse": "6:13",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 252.554,
      "end": 256.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, according to the words of the prophet,",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 256.31,
      "end": 260.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Messiah will set himself again the second time to recover them;",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 260.577,
      "end": 268.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, he will manifest himself unto them in power and great glory, unto the destruction of their enemies,",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 268.605,
      "end": 271.67,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when that day cometh when they shall believe in him;",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 271.85,
      "end": 274.404,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and none will he destroy that believe in him.",
      "verse": "6:14",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 275.084,
      "end": 278.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they that believe not in him shall be destroyed,",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 278.236,
      "end": 281.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both by fire, and by tempest, and by earthquakes,",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 281.853,
      "end": 285.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by bloodsheds, and by pestilence, and by famine.",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 285.702,
      "end": 288.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they shall know that the Lord is God,",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 288.715,
      "end": 290.387,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Holy One of Israel.",
      "verse": "6:15",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 291.067,
      "end": 293.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For shall the prey be taken from the mighty,",
      "verse": "6:16",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 294.033,
      "end": 296.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the lawful captive delivered?",
      "verse": "6:16",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 297.081,
      "end": 298.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 298.979,
      "end": 302.09,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Even the captives of the mighty shall be taken away,",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 302.27,
      "end": 304.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the prey of the terrible shall be delivered;",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 305.144,
      "end": 308.581,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Mighty God shall deliver his covenant people.",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 308.761,
      "end": 310.433,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For thus saith the Lord:",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 310.613,
      "end": 313.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will contend with them that contendeth with thee\u2014",
      "verse": "6:17",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 314.219,
      "end": 317.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I will feed them that oppress thee, with their own flesh;",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 317.928,
      "end": 322.34,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they shall be drunken with their own blood as with sweet wine;",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 322.52,
      "end": 326.653,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all flesh shall know that I the Lord am thy Savior and thy Redeemer,",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 326.833,
      "end": 328.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the Mighty One of Jacob.",
      "verse": "6:18",
      "lineIndex": 103
    }
  ]
}